\newlabel{tab:pca}{{8}{9}{Hidden state geometry. PT models concentrate variance into $\sim $3--6 effective dimensions; RandInit models spread across 400--600. ``90\%'' / ``95\%'' = number of PCs for that cumulative variance}{table.caption.25}{}}
